<title>NETHERLANDS: Polynorm H2 1996 profits below H2 1995.</title>
<headline>Polynorm H2 1996 profits below H2 1995.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plastics processor Polynorm NV said on Monday results in the second half of 1996 were recovering, but would still be below results in the second half of 1995.</p>
<p>Net profits in the whole of 1995 were 26 million guilders. In the first half of 1995 the firm posted a net profit of 11.4 million guilders.  </p>
<p>The firm said it expected turnover and profits to rise in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
